{"name":"신규회원 웰컴 이메일 (첫구매 10% 쿠폰)","assetType":{"id":208,"name":"htmlemail"},"category":{"id":82578},"views":{"subjectline":{"content":"[후지필름몰] 첫 구매 10% 쿠폰이 도착했어요 🎁"},"html":{"content":"%%[ VAR @name SET @name = AttributeValue(\"FirstName\") IF EMPTY(@name) THEN SET @name = \"고객\" ENDIF ]%%<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Transitional//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-transitional.dtd\">\n<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" lang=\"ko\">\n<head>\n<meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=utf-8\" />\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n<meta name=\"x-apple-disable-message-reformatting\" />\n<title>후지필름몰</title>\n<style>\n  body { margin:0; padding:0; -webkit-text-size-adjust:100%; }\n  table { border-collapse:collapse; }\n  img { border:0; line-height:100%; outline:none; text-decoration:none; -ms-interpolation-mode:bicubic; }\n  a { text-decoration:none; }\n  @media only screen and (max-width:620px) {\n    .container { width:100% !important; }\n    .px { padding-left:20px !important; padding-right:20px !important; }\n    .benefit { display:block !important; width:100% !important; padding:12px 0 !important; }\n    .tile { width:33% !important; padding:4px !important; }\n    .tname { font-size:11px !important; }\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body style=\"margin:0; padding:0; background-color:#f4f4f4; font-family:NotoSansKR,'Malgun Gothic','맑은 고딕',Dotum,sans-serif;\">\n\n<!-- ===== Preheader ===== -->\n<div style=\"display:none; max-height:0; overflow:hidden; opacity:0; font-size:1px; line-height:1px; color:#f4f4f4;\">\n  후지필름몰 신규 가입을 환영합니다 — 첫 구매 10% 할인 쿠폰을 지금 만나보세요.&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;\n</div>\n\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"background-color:#f4f4f4;\">\n  <tr>\n    <td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:24px 12px;\">\n\n      <table role=\"presentation\" class=\"container\" width=\"600\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:600px; max-width:600px; background-color:#ffffff; border-radius:10px; overflow:hidden; border:1px solid #eeeeee;\">\n\n        <!-- ===== Header / Logo ===== -->\n        <tr>\n          <td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:24px 0; background-color:#ffffff; border-bottom:1px solid #f0f0f0;\">\n            <img src=\"https://resources.fujifilm.co.kr/upload/img/logo/3/20250522131510622.png\" alt=\"후지필름몰\" width=\"150\" style=\"display:block; width:150px; max-width:60%; height:auto; margin:0 auto;\" />\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- ===== Hero text ===== -->\n        <tr>\n          <td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:40px 32px 4px;\" class=\"px\">\n            <div style=\"font-size:13px; font-weight:bold; letter-spacing:2px; color:#ec1b3b;\">WELCOME</div>\n            <div style=\"font-size:28px; font-weight:bold; color:#221e1f; padding-top:12px; line-height:1.3;\">\n              후지필름몰 가입을 환영합니다\n            </div>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- ===== Greeting + body ===== -->\n        <tr>\n          <td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:16px 40px 8px;\" class=\"px\">\n            <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:15px; line-height:1.7; color:#767676;\">\n              안녕하세요, %%=v(@name)=%%님!<br />\n              후지필름몰의 새로운 회원이 되신 것을 진심으로 환영합니다.<br />\n              첫 구매에 바로 쓸 수 있는 10% 할인 쿠폰을 준비했어요.\n            </p>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- ===== Offer highlight ===== -->\n        <tr>\n          <td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:24px 40px 8px;\" class=\"px\">\n            <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"background-color:#fdedf0; border-radius:10px;\">\n              <tr>\n                <td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:28px 20px;\">\n                  <div style=\"font-size:14px; color:#ec1b3b; font-weight:bold;\">신규회원 전용 혜택</div>\n                  <div style=\"font-size:40px; font-weight:bold; color:#221e1f; padding:6px 0;\">첫 구매 10% 쿠폰</div>\n                  <div style=\"font-size:13px; color:#888888;\">가입 후 첫 주문에 사용 · 발급일로부터 30일간 유효</div>\n                </td>\n              </tr>\n            </table>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- ===== CTA ===== -->\n        <tr>\n          <td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:24px 40px 8px;\" class=\"px\">\n            <table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n              <tr>\n                <td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#ec1b3b\" style=\"border-radius:6px;\">\n                  <a href=\"https://www.fujifilm.co.kr/main.do\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"display:inline-block; padding:15px 42px; font-size:16px; font-weight:bold; color:#ffffff; border-radius:6px;\">\n                    지금 쇼핑하기\n                  </a>\n                </td>\n              </tr>\n            </table>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- ===== Benefits 3-up ===== -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:32px 40px 16px;\" class=\"px\">\n            <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n              <tr>\n                <td class=\"benefit\" width=\"33%\" align=\"center\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px;\">\n                  <div style=\"font-size:26px;\">🎁</div>\n                  <div style=\"font-size:14px; font-weight:bold; color:#221e1f; padding-top:6px;\">첫 구매 10%</div>\n                  <div style=\"font-size:12px; color:#999999; padding-top:2px;\">신규회원 전용 쿠폰</div>\n                </td>\n                <td class=\"benefit\" width=\"33%\" align=\"center\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px;\">\n                  <div style=\"font-size:26px;\">🚚</div>\n                  <div style=\"font-size:14px; font-weight:bold; color:#221e1f; padding-top:6px;\">빠른 배송</div>\n                  <div style=\"font-size:12px; color:#999999; padding-top:2px;\">주문하신 상품을 신속하게</div>\n                </td>\n                <td class=\"benefit\" width=\"33%\" align=\"center\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px;\">\n                  <div style=\"font-size:26px;\">⭐</div>\n                  <div style=\"font-size:14px; font-weight:bold; color:#221e1f; padding-top:6px;\">적립 혜택</div>\n                  <div style=\"font-size:12px; color:#999999; padding-top:2px;\">구매할 때마다 포인트 적립</div>\n                </td>\n              </tr>\n            </table>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- ===== Divider ===== -->\n        <tr><td style=\"padding:16px 40px 0;\"><div style=\"border-top:1px solid #eeeeee;\"></div></td></tr>\n\n        <!-- ===== Footer (CAN-SPAM) ===== -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:20px 40px 32px; background-color:#fafafa;\" class=\"px\">\n            <p style=\"margin:0 0 12px; font-size:11px; line-height:1.6; color:#aaaaaa;\">\n              본 메일은 발신 전용으로 회신할 수 없습니다. 서비스 관련 문의는 고객센터를 이용해 주세요.\n            </p>\n            <p style=\"margin:0 0 12px; font-size:11px; line-height:1.6; color:#aaaaaa;\">\n              This email was sent by: <b>%%Member_Busname%%</b><br />\n              %%Member_Addr%% %%Member_City%%, %%Member_State%%, %%Member_PostalCode%%, %%Member_Country%%\n            </p>\n            <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:11px; color:#aaaaaa;\">\n              <a href=\"%%profile_center_url%%\" alias=\"Profile\" style=\"color:#aaaaaa; text-decoration:underline;\">수신정보 관리</a>\n              &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n              <a href=\"%%unsub_center_url%%\" alias=\"Unsubscribe\" style=\"color:#aaaaaa; text-decoration:underline;\">수신 거부</a>\n            </p>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n      </table>\n\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n\n<custom name=\"opencounter\" type=\"tracking\"/></body>\n</html>\n"}}}